    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me, under Section 92 of the National Water Supply and Drainage Board Act, No. 02 of 1974, I, Anura Karunathilaka, Minister of Urban Development, Construction and Housing, do hereby approve the acquisition of the immovable properties of the allotment of land described in the following schedule as it is required by the said Board, for the laying of Intake and outfall pipes for the seawater Reverse Osmosis Desalination Plant in Thalaiyadi, under Jaffna Kilinochchi Water Supply and Sanitation Project.",
